to control me as a stand user.

106
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:41,117
I filled his mind with lots
of horrifying whispers,

107
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:44,917
and the terror of his bony back being
seen consumed him at the very end,

108
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,917
