he caught the bullet.

129
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,040
Damn, you asshole!

130
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:47,680
Shining diamond, eh?

131
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:49,897
Well, I guess the rumors were true.

132
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:54,280
