And this slip of paper contains
Koichi Hirosei. Bastard!

157
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,615
So you've had Koichi this entire time!

158
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:11,517
I'm picking up Koichi's scent again.

159
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,937
He wasn't holding on to
one of his belongings.

160
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,100
He had Koichi!

161
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:17,257
Rest assured, he's alive.

162
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:20,520
