just a trap to lure me into danger.

199
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:50,333
Looks like I was right.

200
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:56,720
But even so, I still had no other choice
but to go after that stupid scrap of paper.

201
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,297
Despite it being a trap,

202
00:10:58,380 --> 00:11:01,637
