the real Koichi toward that car.

203
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:05,661
And when it comes to my friends,
I don't care if it's a 1 % chance!

204
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:09,314
Losing them is a risk that
I'm just not willing to take.

205
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,597
Mysterioso can have the win for now!

206
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:17,617
It sucks, but there's not much more
Shining Diamond can do at this point.

207
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:18,530
That said,

208
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:22,357
