I become one of your paper prisoners.

209
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:25,397
Rip me to oblivion the
moment I finish folding.

210
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:28,577
Cause if I'm able to make it
out of this bullshit trap alive?

211
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:30,700
I'll freaking kill you!

212
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:42,713
That's a pretty loud bark you had there.

213
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,805
It's too bad you didn't
have the bite to match.

214
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:57,940
Yuya Fungami, allow me to commend you.

215
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,800
Not assisting Josuke was a very wise move.

216
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:03,857
