postponed for the time being.

221
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:18,357
Smart move, my friend.

222
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:23,277
You

223
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:27,577
want to hear

224
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:28,537
