to reach that hotel.

248
00:13:45,980 --> 00:13:49,000
Damn it, Josuke, you're
such a pompous asshole.

249
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:55,137
Seeing you get captured makes
me think about my darling girls.

250
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:59,060
I can't believe I'm saying this,
But if any one of my loving,

251
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:02,237
