into a piece of paper, I'd...

252
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:06,277
I don't even want to think about it,
but if they were nabbed by this creep...

253
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,654
I'd do the same thing to get them back!

254
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:10,740
If I let you or Kira get away,

255
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:13,897
I'd never be able to look at
